<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Video Play Flow" id="ott-seq"><mxGraphModel dx="2000" dy="1500" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="1500" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="t" value="OTT PLATFORM - Video Play Flow (CDN Edge → Manifest Fetch → ABR Segment Streaming)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a237e" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="20" width="1840" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="subtitle" value="4 Phases: (1) Auth + Subscription Check ~100ms | (2) Manifest Fetch (Redis 1ms / MongoDB 5ms) | (3) CDN Segment Streaming ~5ms per chunk | (4) ABR Quality Switching every 6-10s" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#e8eaf6;align=center;rounded=1;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="65" width="1800" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="client" value="Client Device&#10;(iOS/Android)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="clientLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#1976d2;strokeColor=#1976d2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="125" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="cdn" value="CDN Edge&#10;(CloudFront)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8bbd0;strokeColor=#c2185b;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cdnLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#c2185b;strokeColor=#c2185b" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="325" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="gateway" value="API Gateway" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="gwLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#ef6c00;strokeColor=#ef6c00" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="playSvc" value="Play Service" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="playLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#388e3c;strokeColor=#388e3c" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="725" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="redis" value="Redis&#10;(Cache)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="redisLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#f57f17;strokeColor=#f57f17" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="925" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="mongo" value="MongoDB&#10;(Video DB)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="mongoLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#7b1fa2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s3" value="S3 Storage&#10;(Segments)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#c62828;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3Line" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#c62828;strokeColor=#c62828" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1325" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="cassandra" value="Cassandra&#10;(Watch Progress)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cassLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#7b1fa2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1525" y="220" width="10" height="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase1" value="PHASE 1: AUTH + SUBSCRIPTION CHECK" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="230" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s1" value="1. User presses Play&#10;(videoId)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cdnLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s2" value="2. Forward to Gateway" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cdnLine" target="gwLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="3. Validate JWT&#10;Extract userId" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="gwLine" target="playLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s4" value="4. Check subscription&#10;status + expiry" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="playLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s5" value="5. ACTIVE, valid" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="playLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s6" value="6. INCR active_streams:{userId}&#10;Check &lt; plan.maxStreams" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="playLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s7" value="7. count=2, allowed (Premium=4)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="playLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase2" value="PHASE 2: MANIFEST FETCH (Redis cache hit)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fillColor=#fff9c4;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="450" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s8" value="8. GET manifest_url:{videoId}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="playLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s9" value="9. cdn.../master.m3u8&#10;(cache hit, 1ms)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="playLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note1" value="If cache miss (1%):&#10;Query MongoDB ~5ms&#10;Cache result 1 hour" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fillColor=#f3e5f5;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="515" width="140" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s10" value="10. GET last_watched:{profileId}:{videoId}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="playLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s11" value="11. position=1234s&#10;(resume point)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cassLine" target="playLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s12" value="12. 200 OK&#10;{manifestUrl, resumeAt,&#10;sessionId, drmToken}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="playLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase3" value="PHASE 3: SEGMENT STREAMING (CDN edge, 95% cache hit)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#c2185b;fillColor=#fce4ec;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="680" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s13" value="13. GET master.m3u8" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cdnLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s14" value="14. HLS playlist&#10;(4K/1080p/720p/480p&#10;segment URLs)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cdnLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="note2" value="Client measures bandwidth:&#10;3 Mbps → request 720p" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="780" width="140" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s15" value="15. GET seg001_720p.ts&#10;(segment request)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cdnLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s16" value="16. Video chunk&#10;(cache hit, 5ms)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cdnLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note3" value="If cache miss (5%):&#10;CDN fetches from S3&#10;Caches for 7 days" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fillColor=#ffebee;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="845" width="140" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s17" value="17. GET seg002_720p.ts" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cdnLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s18" value="18. Video chunk (cached)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#c2185b;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cdnLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s19" value="19. (every 30s)&#10;POST /stream/heartbeat&#10;{sessionId, position=1264s}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s20" value="20. UPDATE watch_progress&#10;SET position=1264" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cassLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1525" y="1010" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1545" y="1010" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s21" value="21. 204 No Content" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cassLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase4" value="PHASE 4: ABR QUALITY SWITCHING (bandwidth changes)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="1070" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note4" value="Client detects bandwidth↑&#10;10 Mbps → switch to 1080p" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1095" width="140" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s22" value="22. GET seg010_1080p.ts&#10;(quality upgrade)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cdnLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s23" value="23. Video chunk&#10;(seamless, no rebuffer)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cdnLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s24" value="24. Continue streaming..." style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c2185b;dashed=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="cdnLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s25" value="25. (user stops playback)&#10;DECR active_streams:{userId}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="clientLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s26" value="26. count=1 (freed slot)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="clientLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="interview" value="INTERVIEW KEY QUESTIONS&#10;&#10;Q1: Why CDN instead of serving directly from S3?&#10;A1: 15M concurrent streams × 1 segment/6s = 2.5M requests/sec. S3 regional endpoint throttles at ~3500 GET/sec per prefix. CDN with 200+ global PoPs absorbs 95% traffic at edge (5ms latency). Only 5% cache misses hit S3 origin (125K req/sec, manageable). Without CDN: all 2.5M hit S3 → S3 rate limits → infinite buffering globally.&#10;&#10;Q2: How does ABR (Adaptive Bitrate) prevent buffering?&#10;A2: Client measures segment download time every 6-10 seconds, calculates bandwidth. Slow internet (1 Mbps) → requests 480p segments (600 KB). Fast internet (20 Mbps) → requests 4K segments (8 MB). Quality adjusts mid-stream without stopping playback. HLS (.m3u8) and DASH (.mpd) manifest lists all quality variants — client picks URL matching current bandwidth.&#10;&#10;Q3: What is the manifest file and why is it cached in Redis?&#10;A3: Manifest (.m3u8 HLS / .mpd DASH) is table of contents listing all segment URLs in order with metadata (duration, quality, codecs). Client fetches manifest once on play start. Redis caches manifest URL (GET manifest_url:{videoId}) with 1-hour TTL. Cache hit 99% → 1ms response. Cache miss queries MongoDB (5ms). Without Redis cache: every play request hits MongoDB → 50K reads/sec → MongoDB overload → latency spikes to 50ms+.&#10;&#10;Q4: How do you enforce concurrent stream limits per subscription plan?&#10;A4: On play start: Redis INCR active_streams:{userId}. If returned count exceeds plan.maxStreams (Basic=1, Premium=4) → reject with 429 Too Many Streams. On play stop: DECR. INCR/DECR are atomic — prevents race condition where two clients start streams simultaneously and both see count=0.&#10;&#10;Q5: Why Cassandra for watch history instead of MySQL?&#10;A5: 15M concurrent streams × heartbeat every 30s = 500K writes/sec. MySQL maxes out at ~50K writes/sec. Cassandra scales horizontally — linear write throughput increase by adding nodes. Partition key = profileId → all progress for one user on one node. Clustering key = videoId + timestamp DESC → natural time ordering. TTL 90 days auto-expires old data.&#10;&#10;Q6: How does content ingestion pipeline work?&#10;A6: Backend team uploads 100GB master file to S3 → Chunker Service splits into 10-second segments, creates manifest → each chunk published to Kafka → Encoder Service consumes, transcodes to 4K/1080p/720p/480p variants → all encoded segments saved to S3 → manifest URL saved in MongoDB. All async via Kafka. One master file → 2880 encoded files (720 chunks × 4 qualities).&#10;&#10;Q7: What happens if CDN cache is empty (cold start)?&#10;A7: Client requests segment → CDN checks local cache → cache miss → CDN fetches from S3 origin (~200ms first time) → CDN caches segment with 7-day TTL → serves to client. All future requests for same segment served from edge cache (5ms). S3 URL is presigned (time-limited signature) or served via CloudFront OAI (Origin Access Identity) to prevent direct S3 access.&#10;&#10;Q8: How does DRM encryption prevent piracy?&#10;A8: Every video segment encrypted with AES-128. Encryption key stored on license server. On play start, client sends JWT + subscription proof → license server validates → returns decryption key. Client decrypts segments in memory, never saves unencrypted video to disk. Widevine (Google), FairPlay (Apple), PlayReady (Microsoft) are the 3 industry-standard DRM systems. Without DRM: users can download raw segments and share." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1360" width="1880" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
